<title>USA: TENNIS-HINGIS BEATS SELES IN OAKLAND FINAL.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-HINGIS BEATS SELES IN OAKLAND FINAL.</headline>
<dateline>OAKLAND, California 1996-11-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result from the</p>
<p>$450,000 Bank of the West Classic tennis tournament on Sunday</p>
<p>(prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Final</p>
<p>3-Martina Hingis (Switzerland) beat 1-Monica Seles (U.S.) 6-2</p>
<p>6-0</p>
